{"book":"kinney","chapter":"tailwind","chapterTitle":"Tailwind CSS","slug":"has-solutions","title":"حلول تحديات أدوات has-*","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"التحدي-1-حاوية-مربع-الاختيار","text":"التحدي 1: حاوية مربع الاختيار"},{"depth":2,"id":"التحدي-2-تغذية-راجعة-للتحقق-من-النماذج","text":"التحدي 2: تغذية راجعة للتحقق من النماذج"},{"depth":2,"id":"التحدي-3-محتوى-شرطي","text":"التحدي 3: محتوى شرطي"},{"depth":2,"id":"التحدي-4-استجابة-متعددة-العناصر","text":"التحدي 4: استجابة متعدّدة العناصر"},{"depth":2,"id":"التحدي-5-استهداف-الخصائص-المعقدة","text":"التحدي 5: استهداف الخصائص المعقّدة"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"التحدي-1-حاوية-مربع-الاختيار\">التحدي 1: حاوية مربع الاختيار</h2>\n<p>لنبدأ بشيء كهذا:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;checkbox&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;agree&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;agree&quot;</span>&gt;</span>I agree to the terms<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>الخطوة 1</strong>: أضف أصناف التخطيط الأساسية إلى الحاوية</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-4&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;checkbox&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;agree&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;h-4 w-4&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;agree&quot;</span>&gt;</span>I agree to the terms<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>الخطوة 2</strong>: أضف أداة <code>has-*</code> لتغيير الخلفية عندما يكون مربع الاختيار محدَّدًا</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-4 has-[input:checked]:bg-green-50&quot;</span>\n&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;checkbox&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;agree&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;h-4 w-4&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;agree&quot;</span>&gt;</span>I agree to the terms<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>الخطوة 3</strong>: أضف تغيير لون الحد للحصول على تغذية راجعة كاملة</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-4 has-[input:checked]:border-green-500 has-[input:checked]:bg-green-50&quot;</span>\n&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;checkbox&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;agree&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;h-4 w-4&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;agree&quot;</span>&gt;</span>I agree to the terms<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>تستهدف البادئة <code>has-[input:checked]:</code> الحالة التي تكون فيها الحاوية تحتوي على عنصر إدخال محدَّد. يمكنك تطبيق أدوات <code>has-*</code> متعددة لتغييرات بصرية مختلفة.</p>\n<h2 id=\"التحدي-2-تغذية-راجعة-للتحقق-من-النماذج\">التحدي 2: تغذية راجعة للتحقق من النماذج</h2>\n<p><strong>الهدف</strong>: إنشاء حاوية حقل نموذج تعرض اللون الأخضر للإدخال الصحيح والأحمر للإدخال غير الصحيح.</p>\n<p>لنبدأ بشيء كهذا:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Email Address<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">required</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>الخطوة 1</strong>: أضف تنسيق الحاوية وتخطيطها</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-4&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;block text-sm font-medium text-slate-900&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Email Address<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">required</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mt-2 block w-full rounded border-slate-300 px-3 py-2&quot;</span>\n  /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>الخطوة 2</strong>: أضف تنسيق الحالة الصحيحة باستخدام <code>has-[input:valid]</code></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-4 has-[input:valid]:border-green-500 has-[input:valid]:bg-green-50&quot;</span>\n&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;block text-sm font-medium text-slate-900&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Email Address<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">required</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mt-2 block w-full rounded border-slate-300 px-3 py-2&quot;</span>\n  /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>الخطوة 3</strong>: أضف تنسيق الحالة غير الصحيحة وانتقالات سلسة</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-4 transition-colors has-[input:invalid]:border-red-500 has-[input:invalid]:bg-red-50 has-[input:valid]:border-green-500 has-[input:valid]:bg-green-50&quot;</span>\n&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;block text-sm font-medium text-slate-900&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Email Address<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">required</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mt-2 block w-full rounded border-slate-300 px-3 py-2&quot;</span>\n  /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>تعمل حالات التحقق في HTML5 (<code>:valid</code> و<code>:invalid</code>) تلقائيًا مع <code>required</code> و<code>type=&quot;email&quot;</code>. تستجيب الحاوية لحالة التحقق في الإدخال دون أي JavaScript.</p>\n<h2 id=\"التحدي-3-محتوى-شرطي\">التحدي 3: محتوى شرطي</h2>\n<p><strong>الهدف</strong>: بناء سؤال في استبيان يكشف حقل نص عندما يُختار خيار «سيّئ».</p>\n<p>لنبدأ بشيء كهذا:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>How was your experience?<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;radio&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rating&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;good&quot;</span> /&gt;</span> Good<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;radio&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rating&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;poor&quot;</span> /&gt;</span> Poor<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>Please tell us what went wrong:<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>الخطوة 1</strong>: أضف البنية وأخفِ السؤال المتابع افتراضيًا</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-4&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;font-semibold text-slate-900&quot;</span>&gt;</span>How was your experience?<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mt-3 space-y-2&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex items-center gap-2&quot;</span>\n      &gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;radio&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rating&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;good&quot;</span> /&gt;</span> Good&lt;/label\n    &gt;\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex items-center gap-2&quot;</span>\n      &gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;radio&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rating&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;poor&quot;</span> /&gt;</span> Poor&lt;/label\n    &gt;\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mt-4 hidden&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Please tell us what went wrong:<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>الخطوة 2</strong>: استهدف قيمة زر الاختيار المحدّد لإظهار المحتوى</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-4&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;font-semibold text-slate-900&quot;</span>&gt;</span>How was your experience?<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mt-3 space-y-2&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex items-center gap-2&quot;</span>\n      &gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;radio&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rating&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;good&quot;</span> /&gt;</span> Good&lt;/label\n    &gt;\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;flex items-center gap-2&quot;</span>\n      &g